    },
    "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">You are a wealth of wisdom, which you can dispense a number of times per game session equal to your school rank. On your turn or at any appropriate time during a narrative scene, you may dispense a small bit of wisdom to a character who can hear you and has not benefitted from this ability this scene. The next time a character, including yourself, employs that wisdom they may reduce the TN of that check by 1 and may negate a number of (st) up to your ranks in Sentiment or Theology (your choice).</span></p>",
